{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>POINT ZERO GPS 是為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的戶外導航及位置工具，適合遠足、旅遊、戶外活動及位置記錄工作使用。它可儲存重要地點、記錄路線、量度面積、查看方位，並協助你沿原路返回；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-274.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多功能戶外定位</h2>\n<p>你可以分類儲存 GPS 位置，透過多次取樣提升定位點準確度，並以距離、方位及相對方向查看附近已儲存地點。程式亦提供實時指南針、路線記錄與原路返回、面積及距離量度、相片位置標註、GPS 狀態檢查、分享匯出，以及 DD、DMS、UTM 座標格式選擇。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-215-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-216-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-217-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-218-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-219-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-220-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：POINT ZERO GPS</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/point-zero-gps/id6809581006?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T21:04:16.325104+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T20:46:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:34:20.682738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T20:57:46.055004+00:00","content_hash":"a8c873b8e14e783d45be565a0cefe0d89f32d9e045926f1a0a23863eab56e939","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}